Your coding agent writes more code than you can review. Diffmap is an agent skill that has the agent write a spec with interactive diagrams — service diagrams you can step through, diagram and call-stack diffs, and per-phase commit cards — where each part of a diagram links back to its source.

[bookmark: https://diffmap.dev]
